<Introduction>
<Description>
<DisplayWhen>StartDescriptionWithThis</DisplayWhen>
<Text>This game exercises ADRIFT user-defined functions: zero-argument, Text, Number, Object, Character, and Location parameters, plus expression arguments. Type helpudfs for a command list. %Greeting%</Text>
</Description>
</Introduction>
